                                "sense_id": "c7e269e8-c518-3ada-b00d-64729da107aa",
                                "text": "The crest was a tewit's head and neck erased or."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aed663e4-31e7-41e6-82bf-7e02011b508d",
                                "sense_id": "c7e269e8-c518-3ada-b00d-64729da107aa",
                                "text": "My father and uncle searched for a tewit's nest and brought home two eggs which were beaten with milk and sugar for me to eat raw."
                            },
