                                "sense_id": "c7e269e8-c518-3ada-b00d-64729da107aa",
                                "text": "Once in a while, Banks or Sophia would approach too close to a tewit's ground nest, and the birds would start to panic, twittering and flying nervously back and forth, defending their territory."
                            }
